Description: Personal library manager for GNOME
 Book Shelf is a personal library manager built with GTK4 + libadwaita.
 It manages books by ISBN with automatic metadata from Open Library,
 tracks lending with borrowers and a trust score, follows reading with
 status, dates and goals, and reports statistics with pie charts. It can
 import and export Excel spreadsheets and contribute missing books back
 to Open Library.
